WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.707
Structured Analytic Techniques help people think more clearly under uncertainty.

00:00:04.707 --> 00:00:08.392
By identifying assumptions, comparing competing hypotheses, monitoring indicators,

00:00:08.392 --> 00:00:11.157
exploring alternative futures, challenging prevailing views,

00:00:11.157 --> 00:00:12.999
and applying disciplined reasoning,

00:00:12.999 --> 00:00:17.606
analysts can improve the quality and transparency of their judgments.

00:00:17.606 --> 00:00:20.370
These techniques do not eliminate uncertainty,

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:24.977
but they support better decisions across cybersecurity, intelligence, investigations, business,

00:00:24.977 --> 00:00:26.820
and many other fields.
